<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Supplier Requisition Approval" recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__SupplierRequisition__c"> <messaging:htmlEmailBody > <html> <body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff;color:#0f0f0f;text-align:left;"> <table width="600px" align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:20px;"> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:5px;padding-top:10px;padding-right:5px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-left-style:none;border-bottom-style:solid;border-right-style:none;"><apex:image id="KimbleLogo" value="{!$Setup.KimbleOne__KimbleOneConfigSetting__c.KimbleOne__EmailTemplateLogoURL__c}"/></td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1em;font-size:1em;font-weight:bold;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Supplier Requisition Reference: {!relatedTo.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:8px;font-size:.8em;">Please confirm that the following Supplier Requisition should be approved.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">Follow the&nbsp;<apex:outputlink value="{!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140,FIND('.com',$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+4)+relatedTo.Id}">Link</apex:outputlink> to view this Supplier Requisition in Kimble.</td></tr>  <tr><td align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:10px;"> <table style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;border-collapse:collapse;"> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisition__c.Fields.KimbleOne__SupplierAccount__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"> {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__SupplierAccount__r.Name}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisition__c.Fields.KimbleOne__Description__c.Label}: </b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Description__c}</td></tr> <tr><td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;"><b>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisition__c.Fields.KimbleOne__Notes__c.Label}:</b></td><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;">{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Notes__c}</td></tr> </table> </td></tr>  <tr> <td align="left" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding-bottom:10px;padding-top:10px;"> <table style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f0f0f;text-align:left;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.7em;"> <tr> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionLine__c.Fields.KimbleOne__LineNumber__c.Label}</th> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionLine__c.Fields.Name.Label}</th> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionLine__c.Fields.KimbleOne__RequisitionedUnits__c.Label}</th> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionLine__c.Fields.KimbleOne__UnitAmount__c.Label}</th> <th align="center" style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#8da8cd;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionLine__c.Fields.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c.Label}</th> </tr>  <apex:repeat var="line" value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionLines__r}"> <tr> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!line.KimbleOne__LineNumber__c}</td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!line.Name}</td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;">{!line.KimbleOne__RequisitionedUnits__c}</td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;"> <apex:outputText value="{!line.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!line.KimbleOne__UnitAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText></td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;"> <apex:outputText value="{!line.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!line.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText></td> </tr> </apex:repeat> <tr> <td>&nbsp;</td> <td>&nbsp;</td> <td>&nbsp;</td> <td>&nbsp;</td> <td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-color:#c9dae6;border-color:#464b50;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;padding:4px;"> <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText></td> </tr> </table> </td> </tr>  <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;">You can approve or reject this Supplier Requisition, by replying to this email and entering either <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a8d4a;font-weight:bold;">APPROVED</span> or <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#dd1d2e;font-weight:bold;">REJECTED</span> in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner.</td></tr> <tr><td style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:.8em;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;">Regards<br/>{!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}</td></tr> </table> </body> </html> </messaging:htmlEmailBody> <messaging:plainTextEmailBody >  Supplier Requisition Reference: {!relatedTo.Name} Please confirm that the following Supplier Requisition should be approved.  {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisition__c.Fields.KimbleOne__SupplierAccount__c.Label}: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__SupplierAccount__r.Name} {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisition__c.Fields.KimbleOne__Description__c.Label}: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Description__c} {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionVersion__c.Fields.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c.Label}: <apex:outputText value="{!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode} {0,number,#,##0.00}"><apex:param value="{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisitionVersion__r.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c}" /></apex:outputText> {!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__SupplierRequisition__c.Fields.KimbleOne__Notes__c.Label}:{!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Notes__c}  You can approve or reject completion of this Supplier Requisition, by replying to this email and entering either APPROVED or REJECTED in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact the project owner.  Regards {!$Organization.Name} {!$Label.kimbleone__emailtemplatesignature}  </messaging:plainTextEmailBody> </messaging:emailTemplate>